msgstr "新建独立 AP"

msgid "Controller Wi-Fi"
msgstr "UCG Wi-Fi"

msgid "No active network device was found for %s."
msgstr "管理接口 %s 当前没有可用的网络设备。"

msgid "%s is not a network bridge. Select the bridge connected to the UCG."
msgstr "%s 当前不是网桥。请选择连接 UCG 的上联网桥。"

msgid "Local DHCP or router advertisements are enabled on %s. Select the uplink served by the UCG."
msgstr "%s 已配置本地 DHCP 或路由通告。请选择由 UCG 分配地址的上联网桥。"

msgid "Dedicated APs require the UCG IPv4 address in the inform URL."
msgstr "使用独立 AP 时，请在 inform 地址中填写 UCG 的 IPv4 地址。"

msgid "The route to the UCG does not go directly through %s."
msgstr "当前到 UCG 的路由未通过 %s 直连。"

msgid "The UCG could not be confirmed as the client gateway on %s. Check the gateway assigned by DHCP."
msgstr "未能确认 %s 上的客户端网关是 UCG。请核对 DHCP 分配的网关地址。"

msgid "%s uses a different management MAC. Select the interface of the adopted E7."
msgstr "%s 的管理 MAC 与已采用的 E7 不同。请选择采用 E7 时使用的管理接口。"

msgid "Could not verify the uplink for %s."
msgstr "暂时无法核实 %s 的上联状态。"

msgid "The uplink will be checked when you apply the settings."
msgstr "应用设置时将检查所选上联。"

msgid "New APs use %s. UCG supplies DHCP and classifies client traffic. Applying may briefly reconnect this radio."
msgstr "新 AP 接入 %s 网桥，由 UCG 提供 DHCP 并识别客户端流量。应用时该频段可能短暂重连。"

msgid "Controller Wi-Fi applied"
msgstr "UCG 配置已生效"

msgid "Waiting for an applicable controller configuration"
msgstr "正在等待可用的 UCG 配置"

msgid "The chosen secondary AP is no longer available. Reopen settings to refresh."
msgstr "所选频段没有可用的独立 AP，请重新打开设置刷新。"

msgid "Select a new, distinctly named WLAN assigned to this E7 in UniFi Network."
msgstr "请在 UniFi Network 新建一个名称与现有 SSID 不同的 Wi-Fi，分配给 E7 后再选择。"

msgid "Provisioning mode"
msgstr "配置方式"

msgid "SSID already in use"
msgstr "已有 AP 正在使用"

msgid "Choose a native personal or OWE network assigned to the E7. Create a secondary AP here or select an unused, disabled AP."
msgstr "请选择 UCG 已分配给 E7 的原生网络 Wi-Fi，支持个人认证和 OWE。可在此新建独立 AP，或选择已停用的备用 AP。"

msgid "WLAN withdrawn by controller"
msgstr "UCG 已撤下此 Wi-Fi"

msgid "Paused on %s due to an unsupported access policy"
msgstr "%s 的独立 AP 已暂停，BE14 暂不支持该接入策略"
